(x)
To ensure the cooperation of community in co-curricular activities such as Bal Melas, Science exhibition, and game
competitions held in schools;
(xi)
To ensure the Civil works transparently in accordance to the rule-1.9.8 of Chapter-I and 7.1.6 and 7.1.7 of Chapter-VII of
SSA Frame Work;
(xii)
To monitor the construction of school building, maintenance work and other Civil works;
(xiii)
To arrange the furniture and maintenance of school;
(xiv)
To monitor the utilization of annual school grant and school maintenance grant;

10. The School shall maintain the standards and norms of the school as specified in section 19 of the Act. The facilities
reported at the time of last inspection are as given under:
? Area of school campus;
? Total built up area;
? Area of play ground;
? No. of class rooms;
? Room for Headmaster cum Office cum Storeroom;
? Separate toilet for boys and girls;
? Drinking Water Facility;
? Kitchen for cooking Mid Day Meal;
? Barrier free Access;
